  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "I'm Margaret Jo McCullen.",
      "start": 4.54,
      "end": 6.11,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.57,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.57,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0000.wav",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "And I'm Terri Rialto.",
      "start": 6.54,
      "end": 7.99,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.45,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.45,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0001.wav",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "And you're listening to The Delicious Dish on National Public Radio.",
      "start": 7.99,
      "end": 12.26,
      "audio_length_seconds": 4.27,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 4.27,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0002.wav",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Now, Terri, it's Christmas season again, our favorite time of year.",
      "start": 15.24,
      "end": 19.01,
      "audio_length_seconds": 3.77,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 3.49,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0003.wav",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "That's right, Margaret Jo.",
      "start": 19.01,
      "end": 20.82,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.81,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.59,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0004.wav",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "So, holiday time is when the most wonderful culinary wishes can come true.",
      "start": 20.82,
      "end": 25.41,
      "audio_length_seconds": 4.59,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 4.59,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0005.wav",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Now, what's on your list this holiday season, Margaret Jo?",
      "start": 25.91,
      "end": 28.98,
      "audio_length_seconds": 3.07,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.86,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0006.wav",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Well, Terri, I really got greedy this year.",
      "start": 28.98,
      "end": 31.27,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.29,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.89,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0007.wav",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "I'm asking Kris Kringle for a wooden bowl, some oversized index cards, and a funnel.",
      "start": 31.27,
      "end": 38.12,
      "audio_length_seconds": 6.85,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 6.3,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0008.wav",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Oh, a funnel.",
      "start": 39.12,
      "end": 41.05,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.93,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.93,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0009.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "That'll be great for funneling.",
      "start": 41.05,
      "end": 42.92,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.87,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.87,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0010.wav",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "I know.",
      "start": 42.99,
      "end": 43.4,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.41,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.5,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0011.wav",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "I feel like a glutton.",
      "start": 43.4,
      "end": 44.77,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.37,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.35,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0012.wav",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "What's on your list, Terri?",
      "start": 47.41,
      "end": 48.64,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.23,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.18,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0013.wav",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Well, I'm only asking Santa for one thing.",
      "start": 48.64,
      "end": 51.608,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.968,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.468,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0014.wav",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "a big box of glue traps to help me deal with my excessive rat problem.",
      "start": 51.608,
      "end": 56.118,
      "audio_length_seconds": 4.51,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 4.51,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0015.wav",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Now tell me, um, are you, Margaret Jo, going to leave any treats out for Santa this year?",
      "start": 56.878,
      "end": 63.042,
      "audio_length_seconds": 6.164,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 6.164,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0016.wav",
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Oh, absolutely, I always do.",
      "start": 63.042,
      "end": 64.672,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.63,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.63,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0017.wav",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "I'd like to leave Santa some tap water and rice.",
      "start": 64.672,
      "end": 67.622,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.95,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.53,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0018.wav",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "If Santa's anything like me, Christmas foods really wreak havoc on the old digestive system.",
      "start": 70.362,
      "end": 74.712,
      "audio_length_seconds": 4.35,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 4.35,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0019.wav",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "What are you going to leave, Terri?",
      "start": 75.632,
      "end": 76.782,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.15,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.0,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0020.wav",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Uh, I can't ever leave food out in my apartment because I have an excessive rat problem.",
      "start": 76.782,
      "end": 81.432,
      "audio_length_seconds": 4.65,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 4.13,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0021.wav",
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "That's neat.",
      "start": 85.072,
      "end": 85.682,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.61,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.61,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0022.wav",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Santa's fun.",
      "start": 85.682,
      "end": 86.212,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.53,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.53,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0023.wav",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "And it's fun.",
      "start": 86.212,
      "end": 87.202,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.99,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.94,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0024.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Neat.",
      "start": 87.252,
      "end": 87.642,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.39,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.5,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0025.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Yeah, it's fun.",
      "start": 87.642,
      "end": 88.418,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.776,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.776,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0026.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Fun.",
      "start": 88.418,
      "end": 88.718,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.3,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.5,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0027.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Good times, good times.",
      "start": 88.718,
      "end": 90.428,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.71,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.71,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0028.wav",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "That's neat.",
      "start": 90.738,
      "end": 91.428,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.69,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.69,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0029.wav",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Well, Christmas is a time for traditional foods and bite -sized treats, and we have a very special guest today.",
      "start": 93.168,
      "end": 100.518,
      "audio_length_seconds": 7.35,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 7.35,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0030.wav",
      "word_count": 20
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "That's right, Terry.",
      "start": 100.518,
      "end": 101.468,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.95,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.81,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0031.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "He's the owner of his own holiday bakery with a very, very clever name.",
      "start": 101.468,
      "end": 105.698,
      "audio_length_seconds": 4.23,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 4.01,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0032.wav",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Seasons.",
      "start": 106.658,
      "end": 107.528,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.87,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.63,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0033.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Eatings.",
      "start": 107.528,
      "end": 108.138,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.61,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.59,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0034.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "That's really funny.",
      "start": 111.198,
      "end": 112.688,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.49,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.49,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0035.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "I know, it rhymes with season's greetings.",
      "start": 112.688,
      "end": 116.118,
      "audio_length_seconds": 3.43,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 3.32,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0036.wav",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Please welcome the owner of Seasons Eatings, Pete Schweddy.",
      "start": 119.638,
      "end": 124.728,
      "audio_length_seconds": 5.09,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 5.04,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0037.wav",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "start": 125.418,
      "end": 126.188,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.77,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.77,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0038.wav",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Welcome.",
      "start": 128.288,
      "end": 128.678,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.39,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.5,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0039.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "How are you?",
      "start": 128.678,
      "end": 129.098,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.42,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.5,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0040.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Welcome Pete.",
      "start": 129.098,
      "end": 129.77,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.672,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.672,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0041.wav",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "We like the name of your store.",
      "start": 129.77,
      "end": 130.8,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.03,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.03,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0042.wav",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Hi, thanks for having me.",
      "start": 131.38,
      "end": 132.99,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.61,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.42,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0043.wav",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Now, did I pronounce your name correctly?",
      "start": 134.05,
      "end": 136.82,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.77,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.77,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0044.wav",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "You sure did.",
      "start": 136.82,
      "end": 138.27,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.45,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.45,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0045.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Pete Schweddy.",
      "start": 138.27,
      "end": 139.76,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.49,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.13,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0046.wav",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Well Pete, Terry and I have been looking forward to having you on the show because we know you're the master of all kinds of Christmas goodies.",
      "start": 142.26,
      "end": 147.79,
      "audio_length_seconds": 5.53,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 5.53,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0047.wav",
      "word_count": 27
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Tell us about them.",
      "start": 147.79,
      "end": 149.04,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.25,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.83,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0048.wav",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Well, there are lots of great treats at this time of year.",
      "start": 149.66,
      "end": 152.23,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.57,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.43,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0049.wav",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Zucchini bread, fruitcake.",
      "start": 152.23,
      "end": 153.84,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.61,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.61,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0050.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "But the thing that I most like to bring out at this time of the year are my balls.",
      "start": 154.52,
      "end": 158.09,
      "audio_length_seconds": 3.57,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 3.36,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0051.wav",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Mmm.",
      "start": 162.88,
      "end": 163.39,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.51,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.51,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0052.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Mmm.",
      "start": 164.96,
      "end": 165.47,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.51,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.51,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0053.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Mmm.",
      "start": 165.47,
      "end": 165.82,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.35,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.5,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0054.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Balls.",
      "start": 166.35,
      "end": 167.36,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.01,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.01,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0055.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Tell us about your balls, Pete.",
      "start": 169.98,
      "end": 172.13,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.15,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.15,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0056.wav",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Well, over at Seasons Eatings, we have balls for every taste.",
      "start": 173.85,
      "end": 176.74,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.89,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.87,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0057.wav",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Popcorn balls, cheese balls, rum balls, you name it.",
      "start": 177.28,
      "end": 180.17,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.89,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.83,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0058.wav",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Wow.",
      "start": 181.09,
      "end": 181.8,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.71,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.5,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0059.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "My mouth's watering just thinking about those thoughts.",
      "start": 181.8,
      "end": 184.85,
      "audio_length_seconds": 3.05,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.48,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0060.wav",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "It's been years since I've seen any balls.",
      "start": 187.97,
      "end": 190.88,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.91,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.91,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0061.wav",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Would you like to see my balls now?",
      "start": 193.5,
      "end": 195.29,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.79,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.79,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0062.wav",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start": 195.29,
      "end": 196.7,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.41,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.41,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0063.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start": 196.7,
      "end": 197.16,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.46,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.5,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0064.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Whip him out.",
      "start": 197.16,
      "end": 197.79,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.63,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.63,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0065.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "All right, bubba baby.",
      "start": 197.79,
      "end": 198.98,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.19,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.19,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0066.wav",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Oh, wow.",
      "start": 200.98,
      "end": 203.17,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.19,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.19,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0067.wav",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Wow.",
      "start": 203.17,
      "end": 203.54,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.37,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.5,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0068.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Wow, you have some beautiful balls.",
      "start": 203.54,
      "end": 206.97,
      "audio_length_seconds": 3.43,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 3.43,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0069.wav",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "They're bigger than I expected.",
      "start": 208.91,
      "end": 210.36,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.45,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.45,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0070.wav",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "I know a lot of people tell me that.",
      "start": 212.92,
      "end": 214.65,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.73,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.69,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0071.wav",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Look at that, Terry, the way they glisten.",
      "start": 215.51,
      "end": 217.26,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.75,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.75,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0072.wav",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "That's because I make sure that each one of my balls gets plenty of oil.",
      "start": 219.06,
